### Data License and Third-Party Dataset Terms
The original chest radiograph images and lung segmentation masks from the National Library of Medicine (NLM) Montgomery County and Shenzhen Hospital datasets are subject to their respective original data licenses and terms of use from the U.S. National Library of Medicine, the Department of Health and Human Services, and the Shenzhen No. 3 People's Hospital. This MIT License applies strictly to the source code, custom compression algorithms, and evaluation frameworks developed within this repository.
